698	     * Assigns the shared {@code householdId} for a newly mapped owner. The identifier is derived deterministically from
699	     * the owner's last name and postcode (see {@link HouseholdResolver#deriveHouseholdId}), so every owner sharing
700	     * those two fields resolves to the same stable value automatically, regardless of creation order and without any
701	     * explicit linking. An owner created without a postcode has no household and keeps a {@code null} identifier, so
702	     * such owners never match one another as a household.
