19	/**
20	 * Immutable structured audit event recording that an owner was created. Emitted to the dedicated {@code AUDIT} logger as
21	 * a JSON object alongside the human-readable audit line (see
22	 * {@link OwnerRestControllerV1#auditOwnerCreated(org.springframework.samples.petclinic.model.Owner)}).
23	 *
24	 * <p>The event carries the owner's <em>current primary identifier</em> in its {@code primaryId} field: today that is the
25	 * owner's {@code customerCode}, and whatever replaces it later (for instance a unified {@code memberId}) flows through
26	 * the same field unchanged, because the field records "the owner's identity" rather than any one named column. The JSON
27	 * key stays {@code customerCode} for now, matching the identifier it carries.
28	 *
29	 * @param seq         monotonically increasing sequence number across all owner creates
30	 * @param ownerId     the newly created owner's generated id
